wBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s12}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s13}}</span></li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span>{{s14}}</span></li></ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>","uses":1,"slots":[{"k":"s0","type":"s","label":"Label above heading 1","default":"The problem"},{"k":"s1","type":"s","label":"Heading 1","default":"Security controls should be tested, not assumed"},{"k":"s2","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 1","default":"Attackers only need one overlooked weakness to gain access. Vulnerabilities often hide beneath the surface of well-functioning security infrastructure, invisible until someone goes looking for them."},{"k":"s3","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 2","default":"Independent testing gives you an honest, real-world view of where your defences hold and where they don’t, so you can fix the gaps that matter most."},{"k":"s4","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 3","default":"Testing is scoped around what your business actually runs, and the findings come back as a prioritised list of fixes with the remediation work available from the same team. It is priced per user at a fixed monthly cost rather than bundled into rigid packages, so it scales with your team. Everything runs through the same UK service desk that handles your day-to-day tickets, so there is no separate team to chase. Across 2025 our average first response time was 9 minutes and our average resolution time was 6 hours, measured across every ticket we handled."},{"k":"i5","type":"i","label":"Image 1","default":{"html":"<img src=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-penetration-testing-services-1024.webp\" srcset=\"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-penetration-testing-services-640.webp 640w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-penetration-testing-services-1024.webp 1024w, {{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-penetration-testing-services-1600.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 45vw, 100vw\" alt=\"Security tester wearing headphones working at monitors of code in a dark room\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\">","src":"{{ASSETS}}/images/photos/svc-penetration-testing-services-1024.webp"}},{"k":"s6","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 4","default":"Cyber Security"},{"k":"s7","type":"s","label":"Bold text 1","default":"Penetration Testing"},{"k":"s8","type":"s","label":"Paragraph 5","default":"Common risks we uncover"},{"k":"s9","type":"s","label":"List item 1","default":"Internet-facing systems with exploitable vulnerabilities"},{"k":"s10","type":"s","label":"List item 2","default":"Weak authentication controls protecting business applications"},{"k":"s11","type":"s","label":"List item 3","default":"Misconfigured Microsoft 365 and cloud services"},{"k":"s12","type":"s","label":"List item 4","default":"Outdated software containing known security weaknesses"},{"k":"s13","type":"s","label":"List item 5","default":"Excessive user permissions across internal systems"},{"k":"s14","type":"s","label":"List item 6","default":"Network segmentation issues allowing unnecessary access"}]}